@startuml 用例图_总览
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "游客" as Guest
actor "求职者\n(普通用户)" as JobSeeker
actor "企业HR\n(专业用户)" as HR
actor "系统管理员" as Admin

rectangle "招聘信息实时数据分析系统" {

  package "数据采集" {
    usecase "定时采集数据" as UC_Collect
    usecase "监控采集状态" as UC_Monitor
  }

  package "数据分析" {
    usecase "浏览市场概览" as UC_Overview
    usecase "搜索岗位分析" as UC_Search
    usecase "多维度筛选对比" as UC_Filter
    usecase "查看技能需求" as UC_Skill
  }

  package "用户功能" {
    usecase "注册登录" as UC_Login
    usecase "导出分析报告" as UC_Export
    usecase "收藏与订阅" as UC_Favorite
  }

  package "系统管理" {
    usecase "管理用户权限" as UC_UserMgmt
    usecase "手动触发采集" as UC_Trigger
  }
}

Guest --> UC_Overview
Guest --> UC_Login

JobSeeker --> UC_Overview
JobSeeker --> UC_Search
JobSeeker --> UC_Filter
JobSeeker --> UC_Skill
JobSeeker --> UC_Favorite

HR --> UC_Overview
HR --> UC_Search
HR --> UC_Filter
HR --> UC_Skill
HR --> UC_Export

Admin --> UC_Monitor
Admin --> UC_Trigger
Admin --> UC_UserMgmt

JobSeeker -up-|> Guest
HR -up-|> Guest
Admin -up-|> Guest

UC_Collect ..> UC_Monitor : <<include>>
UC_Search ..> UC_Filter : <<extend>>
UC_Export ..> UC_Filter : <<extend>>

@enduml
